# Walter stock assistant

Iframe App Home (React Router / Remix + Polaris web components) plus Sidekick tools. Full map: `AGENTS.md`.

- UI: Polaris web components in `app/routes`. `s-text` uses `color="subdued"`, not `tone`. Do not import `@shopify/polaris`.
- Merchant GraphQL from Remix: `authenticate.admin(request).graphql` via `app/admin-query.server.ts`. Sidekick still uses Direct API in `shared/utils/admin.ts`.
- Inbox: `products(query: "status:active")`, then variants with inventory ≤ threshold. Never `productVariants` + `product_status`.
- Forecast: `shared/utils/forecast.ts` from last 30 days of `orders`. Do not add ShopifyQL or `shopifyqlQuery` here.
- State: variant `$app` metafields + app-installation JSON settings. MongoDB is for OAuth sessions only. Not `shopify.storage`.
- Do not create draft orders or purchase orders. Status `ordered` is a flag only.
- After `shopify app dev --reset`, restore scopes `read_inventory,read_orders,write_products`.
